    "unique_elements": {
      "nonstandard_elements": "Reports multiple consciousness-related events during coma/recovery: (1) later recalling a friend's China-trip conversation that occurred while she was in an induced coma; (2) repeated sighting of a silent little girl hovering near the ceiling for ~2 weeks (interpreted as guardian angel/possibly deceased godchild); (3) a dream-like state with a male voice saying she had 'one more hump' before the life she dreamed of; (4) two separate reports from others (Dr. Maryanne; friend Pat) claiming Mother Mary/Blue Army presence and a message that she would heal but must be patient.",
      "notable_quotes": "“I was out in the universe with the stars as close as the ceiling in my house.”; “seated before the most beautifully lit presence of energy… the greatest divine love.”; “It came out, surrounded, and became a part of me and I became a part of this presence.”; “there was no couch, no chair, no body, no flesh; it was pure consciousness.”; “I did not want to return… The big thing was that I did not want to come back if I had to be in a wheelchair… if I could not speak.”; “Mother Mary… wants me to tell you that she is with you and that you will get well, but you have to be patient; it's going to take time.”; “This just proves that people in comas can hear you when you speak to them.”; “one more hump to go over and then I would have the life I always dreamed of.”"
